    back_text: 'INJECTION SITES (fastest to slowest absorption):\n1. Abdomen - FASTEST\n2. Arm (posterior)\n3. Thigh (anterior/lateral)\n4. Buttocks - SLOWEST\n\nFACTORS AFFECTING ABSORPTION:\n- Exercise: INCREASES absorption at active site\n- Heat: INCREASES absorption\n- Cold: DECREASES absorption\n- Massage/rubbing: INCREASES absorption\n- Lipohypertrophy: DECREASES absorption\n\nPT CONSIDERATIONS:\n- Inject in NON-EXERCISING area\n- Abdomen preferred for consistency\n- Rotate sites within same region\n- Avoid areas with lipohypertrophy\n- Wait 2-4 hours after injection before vigorous exercise\n\nMnemonic: "AATB" = Abdomen, Arm, Thigh, Buttocks (fast to slow)',
    source_pdf_id: null,
    source_page_number: null,
    tags: ['diabetes', 'insulin', 'injection sites'],
