    back_text: "4-point: R crutch → L foot → L crutch → R foot (slowest, most stable)\n\n2-point: R crutch + L foot → L crutch + R foot (faster, reciprocal)\n\n3-point: Both crutches + affected leg → unaffected leg (NWB/PWB)\n\nSwing-to: Both crutches → swing feet TO crutches\n\nSwing-through: Both crutches → swing feet PAST crutches (fastest)",
    source_pdf_id: null,
    source_page_number: null,
