    subcategory_id: 'equip-ada',
    front_text: 'What are ADA requirements for ramps?',
    back_text: 'ADA RAMP REQUIREMENTS:\n\nSLOPE:\n- Maximum: 1:12 (1 inch rise per 12 inches run)\n- Means 8.33% grade\n- Cross slope: Max 1:48 (2%)\n\nRISE:\n- Maximum rise before landing: 30 inches\n- Then must have landing\n\nWIDTH:\n- Minimum: 36 inches clear\n- Preferred: 48 inches\n\nLANDINGS:\n- At top and bottom\n- At direction changes\n- Minimum: 60 x 60 inches\n- Level (max 1:48 slope)\n\nHANDRAILS:\n- Required if rise >6 inches\n- Both sides\n- Height: 34-38 inches\n- Extensions: 12 inches beyond top/bottom\n- Continuous along run\n\nEDGE PROTECTION:\n- Required if drop-off\n- Minimum 4-inch curb\n\nSURFACE:\n- Slip-resistant\n- Stable, firm',
    source_pdf_id: null,
    source_page_number: null,
    tags: ['ADA', 'ramps', 'accessibility'],
  },
  {
    id: 'fc-equip-27',
    subcategory_id: 'equip-ada',
    front_text: 'What are ADA requirements for bathrooms?',
    back_text: 'ADA BATHROOM REQUIREMENTS:\n\nTOILET:\n- Height: 17-19 inches (top of seat)\n- Centerline: 16-18 inches from side wall\n- Clear floor space: 60 inches from side wall\n\nGRAB BARS:\n- Side wall: 42 inches long, 12 inches from rear wall\n- Rear wall: 36 inches long\n- Height: 33-36 inches from floor\n- Diameter: 1.25-1.5 inches\n- Clearance: 1.5 inches from wall\n\nLAVATORY:\n- Knee clearance: 27 inches high\n- Clear floor space: 30 x 48 inches\n- Maximum rim height: 34 inches\n- Insulated pipes for wheelchair users\n\nTURNING SPACE:\n- 60-inch diameter circle OR\n- T-shaped space\n\nMIRROR:\n- Bottom edge maximum: 40 inches from floor\n\nACCESSORIES:\n- Reach range: 15-48 inches from floor',
    source_pdf_id: null,
    source_page_number: null,
    tags: ['ADA', 'bathroom', 'accessibility'],
