  {
    id: 'fc-equip-30',
    subcategory_id: 'equip-wheelchairs',
    front_text: 'What are power wheelchair options and features?',
    back_text: 'POWER WHEELCHAIR OPTIONS:\n\nDRIVE TYPES:\n1. Rear-wheel drive: Stable, outdoor use\n2. Mid-wheel drive: Smallest turning radius, indoor\n3. Front-wheel drive: Climbs obstacles well\n\nSEATING OPTIONS:\n- Tilt-in-space\n- Recline\n- Elevating legrests\n- Seat elevator\n- Standing feature\n\nCONTROL OPTIONS:\n- Joystick (standard)\n- Head control\n- Chin control\n- Sip-and-puff\n- Eye gaze\n- Switch scanning\n\nINDICATIONS:\n- Unable to self-propel manual\n- UE weakness/dysfunction\n- Cardiac/pulmonary limitations\n- Long distances needed\n- Energy conservation\n\nCONSIDERATIONS:\n- Transportation needs\n- Home accessibility\n- Maintenance\n- Battery life\n- Cost\n- Caregiver training',
